/*
capAdd
------

A list of extra Linux capabilities to grant the container.
Example:

  "capAdd": ["SYS_PTRACE"]   // needed to debug C++, Go, Rust, etc.

Default: [] (no additional capabilities).

Use **capAdd** when a task requires privileges that a standard container lacks,
so you don’t have to run the entire environment in full **privileged** mode.
This keeps the setup more secure.
*/
{
  "name": "1_13-spec_capAdd",
  "image": "ubuntu:latest",
  "capAdd": ["SYS_PTRACE"]
}